  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "id": "faq",
      "intro": "Temukan jawaban atas pertanyaan umum terkait penggunaan modul Watch List.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Bedanya Watch List dengan Parameter di Scenario Studio?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Parameter** — Nilai hard-coded tunggal menempel di 1 skenario\n• **Watch List** — Kumpulan data massal terpusat, bisa direferensi ke puluhan skenario\n• Perubahan Watch List otomatis update semua skenario terhubung\n• Tidak perlu revisi satu per satu jika ada update data",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(99,102,241,.1);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px;display:flex;gap:8px'><div style='flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef3c7,#fff);border:1px solid #fcd34d'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#92400e;margin-bottom:6px;text-align:center'>Parameter</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center;line-height:1.4'>Hard-coded<br/>1 Rule only<br/>Manual update</div></div><div style='flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#fff);border:1px solid #a5b4fc'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#4338ca;margin-bottom:6px;text-align:center'>Watch List</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center;line-height:1.4'>Centralized<br/>Many rules<br/>Auto-sync</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Format apa yang didukung untuk Import Watch Value?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Sistem support **CSV** (.csv) dan **JSON** (.json)\n• Ukuran maksimum file: **25 MB**\n• Format Excel (.xlsx / .xls) **tidak** didukung\n• Gunakan CSV untuk file besar (parsing lebih cepat)",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(245,158,11,.1);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#92400e;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>Supported Formats</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px'><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #86efac;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>✓ CSV</span><span style='font-size:7px;color:#64748b'>.csv | Max 25MB</span></div><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#dbeafe;border:1px solid #93c5fd;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af'>✓ JSON</span><span style='font-size:7px;color:#64748b'>.json | Max 25MB</span></div><div style='padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fee2e2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#991b1b'>✗ Excel</span><span style='font-size:7px;color:#64748b'>.xlsx not supported</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Bisakah satu nilai masuk lebih dari sekali?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tidak, Watch Value di dalam satu Watch List harus unik\n• Saat import, sistem akan abaikan atau beri validasi error untuk duplikat\n• Pastikan file sudah bersih dari duplikasi sebelum Finalize Import\n• Gunakan spreadsheet untuk validasi data sebelum upload",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(239,68,68,.1);border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef2f2,#fff);border:1px solid #fca5a5'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px'><svg width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.5'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='10'/><line x1='15' y1='9' x2='9' y2='15'/><line x1='9' y1='9' x2='15' y2='15'/></svg><span style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#991b1b'>Duplicate Not Allowed</span></div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#475569;line-height:1.5'>Watch Value dalam 1 list harus unique.<br/>System auto-reject duplikasi saat import.<br/>Validate file sebelum upload.</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Kenapa tab Watch Value tidak bisa diakses?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Modul dilindungi **Permission Role** spesifik:\n• `VIEW_WATCH_LIST_WATCH_VALUE` — visibilitas tab Watch Value\n• `ADD_WATCH_LIST_WATCH_VALUE` — tombol Add New Record\n• `EDIT_WATCH_LIST_WATCH_VALUE` — tombol Edit Entry\n• `DELETE_WATCH_LIST_WATCH_VALUE` — tombol Decommission Record\n• Hubungi Administrator untuk mendapat izin akses",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#faf5ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(124,58,237,.1);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#6b21a8;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>Required Permissions</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px'><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>VIEW</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Tab visibility</span></div><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #93c5fd;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af'>ADD</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>New record</span></div><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#92400e'>EDIT</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Update entry</span></div><div style='padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fee2e2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#991b1b'>DELETE</span><span style='font-size:6px;color:#64748b'>Decommission</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Cara export semua Watch Values sekaligus?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka **Review Details** → pilih tab **Export**\n• Klik tombol **Select All** untuk pilih semua nilai\n• Klik **Finalize Export (n)** untuk download\n• File CSV auto download: `watch_value - [timestamp].csv`",
          "color": "#0ea5e9",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(14,165,233,.1);border:1px solid #bae6fd;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px'><div style='font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#075985;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center'>Export Workflow</div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px'><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px'><div style='width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>1</div><span style='font-size:8px;color:#0f172a'>Open Review Details</span></div><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px'><div style='width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>2</div><span style='font-size:8px;color:#0f172a'>Click Select All</span></div><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px'><div style='width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#0ea5e9;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'>3</div><span style='font-size:8px;color:#0f172a'>Finalize Export</span></div><div style='padding:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center'><span style='font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#166534'>📥 watch_value-2024-01-15.csv</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
